        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2075_7765.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freündt</unclear>-, nachbarlich willig dienst und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">grueß</unclear>, zuvor,
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fromm</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürnem</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weyß</unclear>, insonders <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guet</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freünd</unclear>,
<lb n="3"/>und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getreüwe</unclear> lieb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachbarn</unclear>.
<lb n="4"/>Eüwer an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uns</unclear>, für <persName resp="#ner">Martin <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Straußen</unclear></persName>, wegen deß
<lb n="5"/>gegen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unserm</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Schuelkisten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bewüßten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">usstands</unclear>, ab=
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gangen</unclear> schreiben, haben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sowol</unclear> wir, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">als</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">auch</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unsre</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verordnete</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Schuelherren</unclear>, angehört, und
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">darauß</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Andreas</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Roßachers</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vorhaben</unclear> und anerbieten,
<lb n="9"/>wol verstanden.
<lb n="10"/>Nun <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wolten</unclear> wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> gern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jederzeit</unclear> allen
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angenemen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolgefelligen</unclear> willen erzeigen, wie
<lb n="12"/>dann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eben</unclear> von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüwertwegen</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> zuogefallen,
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unsre</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Schuelräht</unclear> in diser sach <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sovil</unclear> und
<lb n="14"/>lange <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jar</unclear> und tag (wie ihr selbs <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wüssen</unclear>) <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gedult</unclear>
<lb n="15"/>getragen.
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wann</unclear> nun aber in allem dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jenigen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">was</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">man</unclear>
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auf</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">des</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Straußen</unclear> diser sach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">halben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jederweilen</unclear> versprochen,
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seyten</unclear> nichts oder gar wenig gehalten; So
<lb n="19"/>werden <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ihrs</unclear> zu <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unguetem</unclear> nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">aufnemen</unclear> können,
<lb n="20"/>wann schon <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mehrgedachte</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unsre</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Schuelräht</unclear> nun
<lb n="21"/>mehr <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unwillig</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">worden</unclear>, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">derowegen</unclear> sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> kein
<lb n="22"/>ander geding <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">einlassen</unclear> mögen.
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Sytemmal</unclear> dann ihr, (<unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">innhalt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beyligender</unclear>
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">copey</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eüwers</unclear> an uns deßhalb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ervolgten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schreibens</unclear>)
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">versprochen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unserm</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Schuelkisten</unclear> auf <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Martinj</unclear>
<lb n="26"/>(der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">albereit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürrüber</unclear>) <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vmb</unclear>
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hauptgut</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zinß</unclear> kosten und schaden, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vollkomenlich</unclear>
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuentrichten</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Als</unclear> haben ihr <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Letst=</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2075_7766.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="29"/>ein außzug, was angeregter <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unsrer</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Schluesseren</unclear> noch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußstaht</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beÿverwart</unclear> zu=
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">empfahen</unclear>. Worauf wir uns zu <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear>
<lb n="32"/>versehen, ihr werdet solche forderung
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angends</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">richtig</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abrichten</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bezahlen</unclear> lassen.
<lb n="34"/>Daran erstatten ihr <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eüwer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">versprechen</unclear>, und
<lb n="35"/>wirt fernerer <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unkosten</unclear> (der sonst darauf
<lb n="36"/>getriben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wurde</unclear>) hiemit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermitten</unclear>.
<lb n="37"/>Und wo wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sonsten</unclear> in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ander</unclear> weg allen
<lb n="38"/>guten nachbarlichen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">willen</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freündschafft</unclear>
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">koennen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erzeigen</unclear>, darzu habt ihr uns
<lb n="40"/>willig. Gottes obhalt uns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">saembtlich</unclear> wol
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bevelhende</unclear>. Datum den. <origDate when="1622" resp="#ner">27.ten Novembris
<lb n="42"/>Anno <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">1622</unclear></origDate>.
<lb n="43"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">B. und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Rht</unclear>.</orgName>
<lb n="44"/>An die von <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-524" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Arbon</unclear></orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2075_7767.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2075_7768.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="45"/>An <origPlace ref="stadtasg-places-5" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Arbon</origPlace> <origDate when="1617" resp="#ner">27. 9br. 1617</origDate>. wegen <persName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Martin
<lb n="46"/>Straußens</persName>
</p>
